00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:28.790
- Sure, Sal Khan, founder
and CEO Khan Academy,

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:31.590
which as you introduced
to us, many people know

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:33.150
we're not for profit organization

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:36.080
with a mission of providing
a free world class education

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.890
for anyone anywhere.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:41.910
And as you mentioned, it started
over actually 14 years ago.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:44.815
Well, 14 years ago was
actually when we did set up

00:02:44.815 --> 00:02:47.176
as a not-for-profit, but
it started back in 2004

00:02:47.176 --> 00:02:50.320
as a tutoring project where I
was an analyst at a hedge fund

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:53.070
and I started tutoring one
family member remotely,

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:55.360
I was in Boston, she was in new Orleans.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.150
That went well, it was helping her,

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.720
I became what I call a tiger cousin.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.750
I started tutoring more cousins.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:03.340
Before I knew it, word spread in my family

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:05.376
that free tutoring was going on,

00:03:05.376 --> 00:03:06.440
and I was tutoring 10 or 15 cousins.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.690
And I saw patterns that the reason

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:10.410
why they were oftentimes struggling

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:12.060
was because they just had
gaps in their knowledge.

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:13.300
So I started writing software for them,

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.040
my original background was in software.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.310
So I did this as a hobby for them

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:17.920
to get as much practice as they want.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.760
And then a friend suggested
that I make videos

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.000
to supplement the software.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.870
I thought it was a silly idea at first,

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:23.810
but I gave it a shot,

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:26.830
and those videos also took
on a life of their own.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:31.830
And by 2008 is when I formally
incorporated Khan Academy

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:33.860
and set it up as a not-for-profit.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.470
You know, you fast forward to today,

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:37.000
what started with a handful of cousins

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.740
is now 130 million red registered users,

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.370
about 30 million folks come
every month to the platform,

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:46.640
we're in 50 languages around the world.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:49.238
But our mission, free
world class education

00:03:49.238 --> 00:03:51.119
for anyone anywhere is
still the same mission.

00:03:51.119 --> 00:03:52.135
And our vision is,

00:03:52.135 --> 00:03:54.030
can we offer all of the
core academic content

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:56.190
from pre-K through the core of college

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:58.070
for anyone in the world,
everyone in the world,

00:03:58.070 --> 00:03:59.739
in all the world's major languages?

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:01.130
Can we do it in a way

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.660
that really meets students where they are?

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:04.394
And so these are principles,

00:04:04.394 --> 00:04:06.450
I'm happy to talk more about
it, of personalization,

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.950
empowering students,
meeting them where they are,

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:12.127
mastery learning, which is
always having the opportunity,

00:04:12.127 --> 00:04:14.076
the incentive to improve where you are,

00:04:14.076 --> 00:04:15.370
instead of just getting a C and moving on,

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:20.370
keep working on it so that
you can get to 90% or 100%.

00:04:20.695 --> 00:04:22.070
And then the third
pillar of our vision is,

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.640
how can we make that learning translate

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:25.375
into real opportunity?

00:04:25.375 --> 00:04:28.520
Getting into college, get a
job, whatever it might be.

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:31.500
So come a long way since those early days,

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.060
but still a long way to go.

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:36.283
We aspire to empower
billions hopefully over time.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:39.110
- Thank you so much for
sharing that background.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.830
And I know there's a lot of educators

