00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:38.349
- I will add on some of those comments,

00:20:38.349 --> 00:20:40.520
I love the idea of making videos,

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.580
obviously I spent a
lot of time doing that.

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:45.350
And there is, if especially maths,

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:47.840
